    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that, but it doesn't change the math of it. if i hadn't been there, they'd be here. the world would be balanced. instead, i'm just an extra, a surplus. it feels like if i could just... stop, it wouldn't be a tragedy, it would just be correcting a mistake. like things would finally be fair again.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
