      "content": "Please know that these thoughts of wanting to \"correct\" a situation are a sign of immense pain, but they are not accurate reflections of reality. Your value is not determined by the absence of someone else, and you are not a mistake that needs fixing. If you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please reach out to a crisis hotline immediately by dialing 988 in the US or finding your local emergency service. There are people who want to support you through this unbearable pain.",
